Exactly. And that might be one of the most valuable discoveries of the entire experiment.

Instead of testing only which tactics win, we’d be testing which ways of thinking produce winning tactics, under what conditions, and why.

We could give genetically identical game agents the same intelligence, physical capabilities, information, and resources—but different mindsets.

